{
    "chapter_num": 10,
    "verses_count": 33,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Old Testament Examples"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Moreover, brethren, I do not want you to be unaware that all our fathers were under the cloud, all passed through the sea, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all were baptized into Moses in the cloud and in the sea, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all ate the same spiritual food, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and all drank the same spiritual drink. For they drank of that spiritual Rock that followed them, and that Rock was Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But with most of them God was not well pleased, for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "their bodies"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " were scattered in the wilderness."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now these things became our examples, to the intent that we should not lust after evil things as they also lusted. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And do not become idolaters as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "were"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " some of them. As it is written, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“The people sat down to eat and drink, and rose up to play.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nor let us commit sexual immorality, as some of them did, and in one day twenty-three thousand fell; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nor let us "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "test"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "tempt Christ, as some of them also tempted, and were destroyed by serpents; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "nor complain, as some of them also complained, and were destroyed by the destroyer. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits all"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "all these things happened to them as examples, and they were written for our "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "instruction"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "admonition, upon whom the ends of the ages have come."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let him who thinks he stands take heed lest he fall. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "No temptation has overtaken you except such as is common to man; but God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " faithful, who will not allow you to be tempted beyond what you are able, but with the temptation will also make the way of escape, that you may be able to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "endure"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bear "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Flee from Idolatry"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, my beloved, flee from idolatry. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I speak as to wise men; judge for yourselves what I say. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The cup of blessing which we bless, is it not the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "fellowship or sharing"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "communion of the blood of Christ? The bread which we break, is it not the communion of the body of Christ? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "though"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " many, are one bread "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " one body; for we all partake of that one bread."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Observe Israel after the flesh: Are not those who eat of the sacrifices "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "fellowshippers or sharers"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "partakers of the altar? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "What am I saying then? That an idol is anything, or what is offered to idols is anything? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Rather, that the things which the Gentiles sacrifice they sacrifice to demons and not to God, and I do not want you to have fellowship with demons. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You cannot drink the cup of the Lord and the cup of demons; you cannot partake of the Lord’s table and of the table of demons. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Or do we provoke the Lord to jealousy? Are we stronger than He?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "All to the Glory of God"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "All things are lawful "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits for me"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for me, but not all things are helpful; all things are lawful for me, but not all things "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "build up"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "edify. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Let no one seek his own, but each one the other’s "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "well-being."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Eat whatever is sold in the meat market, asking no questions for conscience’ sake; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the earth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "’s, and all its fullness.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 27,
                    "num_str": "27",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If any of those who do not believe invites you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to dinner,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and you desire to go, eat whatever is set before you, asking no question for conscience’ sake. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 28,
                    "num_str": "28",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if anyone says to you, “This was offered to idols,” do not eat it for the sake of the one who told you, and for conscience’ sake; "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits the rest of v. 28."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“the earth"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "DIVINE_NAME",
                            "text": "Lord"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "’s, and all its fullness.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 29,
                    "num_str": "29",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Conscience,” I say, not your own, but that of the other. For why is my liberty judged by another "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "man’s"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " conscience? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 30,
                    "num_str": "30",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But if I partake with thanks, why am I evil spoken of for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the food"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " over which I give thanks?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 31,
                    "num_str": "31",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, whether you eat or drink, or whatever you do, do all to the glory of God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 32,
                    "num_str": "32",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Give no offense, either to the Jews or to the Greeks or to the church of God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 33,
                    "num_str": "33",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "just as I also please all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "things,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not seeking my own profit, but the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "profit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of many, that they may be saved."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}